# Copy to reviewer/.env (gitignored). Locally the Agent SDK can use your Claude Code login instead;
# CI needs a Console key (console.anthropic.com → API Keys), stored as a repository secret.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional overrides
# REVIEW_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
# REVIEW_MAX_BUDGET_USD=0.5   (code default; CI passes 0.1 through .github/actions/ai-reviewer)
# Optional PR context, fenced as untrusted input; the body is cut to 4,000 characters (src/prompt.ts).
# CI sets both from the pull request; leave them unset for a diff-only review.
# PR_TITLE=
# PR_BODY=
